{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "fc17a182dc7be5a4dbfc92de9d73f240fadfccf6264e20d4e18d101b0fa78d1f", "ja": "あははっ、すごい歓声だな～！　なんかみんな、\nいつも以上に盛り上がってる気がする！", "zh": "啊哈哈，好大的欢呼声啊～！总觉得大家比平时还要兴奋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "1e3fe41cc22ad5d90c1f4420168cbc4b8235e4755a5862995cded28acd286769", "ja": "くーっ、ボクも負けないよう気合いを入れなきゃ！\nえ～っと……。", "zh": "唔——我也得鼓足干劲，不能输给大家！  \n呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1f531c1232ad883db298838131b60b940b59d91ca9eab38811acbe44e04f2f04", "ja": "真、ここにいたんだな。\n姿が見えなかったから、探したよ。", "zh": "真，原来你在这里啊。\n因为没看到你的身影，我找了你好一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "b76555d89b46f8d681a26f0ce6149ee90793170131a259c66c000bec1f84575e", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nさすが、ちょうどいいところに来てくれました！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n不愧是你，来得正是时候！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b77ad00f71cc90731804308cae5a60f1826ba2a9f38b7275295e4a1bcf395973", "ja": "ちょうどいい？", "zh": "正好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "a8d2d36f7258d352a15348dbe19c00e9308de9e939d115b9fd1ccb564285384b", "ja": "はい！　もうすぐボクの出番ですよね。\nというわけで……いつものお願いします！", "zh": "好的！马上就要轮到我上场了吧。\n所以……还是照老规矩来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7d0a00a8faa74b6d85a688c83b0efd6c266e56a65ae03e15d88e472f86fd0c1c", "ja": "ああ、なるほど。\nわかった！　行くぞ……！", "zh": "啊，原来如此。\n明白了！上了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_1008", "source_sha256": "40325c97d227c15ced4bc739bdf8d13a4b5f9608d3f183a193e8ccc0f51bd55b", "ja": "拳を突き出す", "zh": "伸出拳头", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_2000_006mak", "source_sha256": "93947456ba24544167f030510ba9e02d0b8d55c1e745c878975d437a8f1d47f5", "ja": "ダーンッ！　へへっ、やーりぃ！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "砰！嘿嘿，成功啦！\n谢谢您，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_2001_006mak", "source_sha256": "5792c3727f96553bf5924d8a1ad6e19d2c1098b0da9b4b8d28310be863df3173", "ja": "ボク、これをやらないと物足りないんですよね。\n気合いが入るっていうだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "我不做这个的话，总觉得少了点什么。并不只是因为能让我鼓起干劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_2002_006mak", "source_sha256": "f3c8d0a17c48901bac8654b63c7418a5ee84b402c015a56b07b3666ab21b8048", "ja": "不安がなくなるんです。よし、これで今日は最高の\nパフォーマンスができる！って思えて。", "zh": "不安会消失的。这样一来，我就觉得今天一定能发挥出最棒的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_2003_p", "source_sha256": "4453bfd3bac3eea4ae75aa00f73062925f0a075be8be18de6dabe620da9f44ab", "ja": "おお。なんだかすごい自信だな！", "zh": "哦，感觉自信满满啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_2004_006mak", "source_sha256": "1d3ded284d787a46d857f79a2b6dec511fd5f4c8484153312ebd383ad0008ed1", "ja": "へへっ、任せてください！　{$P$}と\n拳を重ねた数だけ、ボクも成長してますからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，交给我吧！我和{$P$}碰拳的次数越多，也就成长得越多嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_2005_p", "source_sha256": "048f11fc43e47479ed8ecc8f4784e14e90ba6e81be0c3b2f540a0fd0bb991852", "ja": "頼もしい限りだよ。それだけ自信があるなら、\nもう俺の手は必要ないんじゃないか？", "zh": "真让人放心啊。既然你这么有自信，说不定已经不需要我的帮助了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_2006_006mak", "source_sha256": "4ef4a3f8f0a0935952ffd249b720d5d64e5dd246341be206ca847f28d851ff7b", "ja": "うわ、やめてくださいよー！　やだなぁ、もう。\nそんなわけないじゃないですか。", "zh": "哇，请别这样说啦～！真是的，讨厌啦。\n怎么可能会那样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_2007_006mak", "source_sha256": "67ecff55aa827bc50033e158cd90283aa2d5d5d9a0e9f473b231a7baefd80ea7", "ja": "ボクはまだまだ伸び盛りなんですからね！\nひとりじゃ、うまく成長できないんですー！", "zh": "我还正处于快速成长的阶段呢！\n一个人的话，可没法好好成长——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0392_story_006mak_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0392_story_006mak_2008_006mak", "source_sha256": "33c6e8e2a0b0779d57d0b80bf77cb195068eb802d6b1e8977ae6931557f21c17", "ja": "だから、{$P$}。これからも、\n何回でも！　ボクと拳を合わせてくださいね♪", "zh": "所以，{$P$}，今后也请一次又一次地和我碰拳吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
